   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen247.0012",
   "jp": "{v:0004}さすがに敵が多いな。",
   "en": "{v:0004}There are plenty of enemies, all right.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen247.0013",
   "jp": "{v:000C}みんな、用意はいいですか？{p}{v:000D}では行きましょう。",
   "en": "{v:000C}Is everyone ready?{p}{v:000D}Then let us go.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen247.0014",
   "jp": "{v:0003}そっちじゃない。{n}城は街の北西だ！",
   "en": "{v:0003}Not that way. The castle is in the northwest of town!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen247.0015",
   "jp": "ま、まだ‥‥",
   "en": "N-not yet...",
